        "contextDocumentText": "Forms Core Backend Server\n\nSumo Logging\nVarious backend activities are logged to Sumo Logic\n\nCommon Queriers\nBuild your own queries\n- Log Messages what to look for. All of our loggable events\n- Parameters what to filter (date range, specific to form therefore formId, specific to submitAction, specific to submissions)\n\nCommon Questions:\n- Email delivered to foreign server\n- Report ran\n- Report sent\n- Submit action ran\n- Submit action run for a particular submission\n- Errors\n  - SubmitAction fail\n  - Failed to send email\n  - Failed to complete submit action\n\nRestrictions/Limitation\n- Only 90 days of log activity\n- We ingest 10,000 messages a minute - results/filters are necessary; the more specific the better\n- \"Error\" are often downgraded to \"Warn\".\n- \"Log Level\" is suggestive and not specific; sometimes we have info or warn messages that could be considered 'error'\n- We never log debug in production",
