        "conversationText": "#CASE ASSIST\n&lt;@Daryl Daniot&gt; *Is requesting assistance on this ticket:*  \n*Here is the Form Id: n/a\n*Here is the issue they're trying to solve:*  The customer received a notice indicating that their confirmation emails may be deactivated soon. I searched in Sumo but did not find any bounce emails in the past 30 days. Could you please advise on why they received this notice? Thank you.\n\nCase: 00736980\n*Troubleshooting steps taken or team that they think may need to get involved:* *Impersonation access granted* Yes \n*Email or Org ID associated with impersonation access:* <mailto:support@warmthoughts.com|support@warmthoughts.com>\n\n*Please take a look at this and see if you can help.  If not, please respond in a thread so that they know to go ahead and escalate the ticket.*\n\nHow old is the email and did she give you the right account email. I search that email and account number in Sumo, CP Sendgrid, and could not find anything going back 30 days.\nI did see that they had alot of forms that were \"ok'd\" but no recent warning messages.\n\nHi Trudie <@U017KBHFX3N>, it appears the notice was received through (<mailto:arosenthal@warmthoughts.com|arosenthal@warmthoughts.com>), which I clarified earlier. However, the customer mentioned that the notice actually came to the account (<mailto:support@warmthoughts.com|support@warmthoughts.com>). I also checked this other email in Sumo, but there were still no bounce instances in the past 30 days.\nPlease see the attached screenshot of the email they received\n\nNo text content\n\nBumping this case. Thank you\n\n<@U076YRZG4EA> I got the escalation. I'm taking a look now.\n\nI have not found anything. I have searched both email address, account numbers. I found another account but even that one is in good standing.\n\nI was starting to look at jwoodbury to see if that account was attached to anything.\n\nLikewise. I'm not seeing anything just yet.\n\nDoes Sumo log the warning emails? I did a log search for <mailto:arosenthal@warmthoughts.com|arosenthal@warmthoughts.com> on the day of the email and I'm not seeing anything except 14 Zuora-related logs.\n\nYes, it logs the bounces and the reasons why it bounced. Do you have that script?\n\nI believe so; this is what I use:\n```_sourceName=\"/var/log/formstack/app.log\"\nAND \"SendGrid webhook for sendgridMessageId {sendgridMessageId}\"\n| json field=_raw \"context.accountId\" as accountId\n| json field=_raw \"context.formId\" as formId\n| json field=_raw \"context.sendgridEvent\" as sendgridEvent\n| json field=_raw \"context.recipient\" as recipient\n| json field=_raw \"context.reason\" as reason\n| where accountId =\"883394\"\n| where sendgridEvent = \"bounce\"```",
