        "conversationText": "*Name*\nCorey Hosch\n*Case Number*\n00764313\n*Email or Org ID associated with impersonation access*\n<mailto:jaikrishna.patel@ascension.org|jaikrishna.patel@ascension.org>\n*Form ID*\nn/a\n*How can we help you?*\nCustomer has a question about our use of DataDog. \n\nWe are using Dyntatrace as our APM tool and we were observing that for the above form, we are observing Data Dog API calls. So want to understand if FormStack Forms are leveraging Data Dog for RUM - Real User Monitoring and that is the reason for the references to DataDog (<https://static.formstack.com/forms/forms-renderer/builds/public/form_c094ebe497.js).>\n\nCan you please confirm if Formstack is leveraging Data Dog for its own analytics.\n*Troubleshooting steps taken*\n-\n*Were you able to replicate the issue?*\nno\n\nI think we are using DataDog but to what extent <@UT5GJ52TS> maybe able to answer better.\n\nI know we use Data Dog for APM, but this is the first I have heard of RUM.\n\nLets ask in <#C04BMKVFH|>\n<https://formstack.slack.com/archives/C04BMKVFH/p1738863054407609>\n\nYes.  We use Datadog for APM/RUM.",
